14f362e88af890e851fbc9 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/328714 Commit-Ready: Kalin Stoyanov &lt;kalin@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Kalin Stoyanov &lt;kalin@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Sridhar Sonti &lt;sontis@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="328714" owner_email="kalin@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/14/328714/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I46e55e21a5206d605a2244ff93486b4c6bdf7aaa" commit="975e4a13f4466027830ae7936f4ea1eeb8bda864" commit_message="Add missing header &lt;sys/stat.h&gt; to device_manager.cc  device_manager.cc needs the definition for 'struct stat' from this header.  Currently, it relies on getting it included indirectly through &lt;libudev.h&gt;.  The dependency on &lt;sys/stat.h&gt; was unused in &lt;libudev.h&gt; and was removed upstream on commit 2eec67acbb0059 (first included in systemd/udev v220.) Upgrade to that or a later version would cause the mtpd build to break.  Make the dependency explicit here, to prevent any future breakage when the package owning &lt;libudev.h&gt; is upgraded.  BUG=None TEST=Built packages on swanky systemd v226.   Confirmed no build breakage with current versions.  Change-Id: I46e55e21a5206d605a2244ff93486b4c6bdf7aaa Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/325760 Commit-Ready: Filipe Brandenburger &lt;filbranden@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Filipe Brandenburger &lt;filbranden@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Lei Zhang &lt;thestig@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="325760" owner_email="sabin.floares@intel.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="6" project="chromiumos/platform/mtpd" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/mtpd" ref="refs/changes/60/325760/6" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" c